    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Lufthansa Business Class\nTAFELFREUDEN\nStar Chefs\nMenu",
      "Lufthansa Business Class\n• Lufthansa Business Class\nMenu\nDinner\nHors d'oeuvre\nMarinated Crayfish and Asparagus\nAromatic Couscous with roasted Veal\nand Lime Crème Fraîche\nSalad\nFrisée and Arugula\nwith Bell Pepper Julienne and fresh Herbs\npresented with Basil Olive Oil Dressing\nBread, Rolls and Butter\nEntrees\nGuinea Hen accompanied by Olive Gnocchi\nand Morel Mushroom and Leek Ragoût\nPoached Fillet of River Trout\nserved with Vegetable Stew\nand Semolina Diamonds\nin Apple Horseradish Sauce\nCelery Ravioli on Basil Cream\nwith sun-dried Tomatoes, Kohlrabi,\nZucchini and Carrots\nEntrees\nPlease choose one of the following:\nCold Gourmet Plate\nSmoked Salmon and Potato Salad with Pesto,\nBreast of Duck, marinated Mushrooms\nand Zucchini\nor\nHot Specialty\nLasagne with grilled Vegetables\nand Tomato Coulis\nFrom the Bread Basket\na selection of Rolls and Bread\nwith Butter\nDessert\nAlmond Tartlet\nenhanced by Rose-Hip Sauce\nlight\nCheese and Dessert\nPetit Breton, Castello Blue and Ash Goat Cheese\nserved with Grapes and toasted Pine Nuts\nPeppered Chocolate Mousse\nenhanced by Strawberry Rhubarb Compote\nFresh Fruit Salad\nLANDHAUS\nSt. URBAN\n220C501-C\nLANDHAUS\nSt. URBAN\nPlease accept our apology if occasionally your selection is not available.\n5 220C501-C\nEnglish\nFrancais\nGetränke / Beverages"
